# 02-frontend/nextjs-app-router
# ⚠️ Next.js reads .env.local for your machine's values:  cp .env.example .env.local
# Full explanation of every variable: ../../docs/03-env-files-and-secrets.md
#
# 🚨 THE RULE: anything prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ is BAKED INTO THE BROWSER BUNDLE
#    and readable by every visitor. Never put a secret behind that prefix.

# Visible to the browser. Safe: it is just an address.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=Stack Dojo

# No prefix → server-side only, never sent to the browser.
API_INTERNAL_URL=http://localhost:3001

# Cookie name the middleware looks for.
AUTH_COOKIE_NAME=dojo_session
